  <ProfessionalSummary>覆盖膨胀水箱自动补水、排气、压力稳定及容积补偿功能，基于DNV规则、IACS UR E10、ISO 8861及调试海试程序等证据。</ProfessionalSummary>
  <EngineeringRequirements count="4">
    <Requirement id="ER-P042-01" level="1" requirementType="function">
      <sysml:Name>膨胀水箱自动补水功能</sysml:Name>
      <sysml:Text>膨胀水箱应配置自动补水装置，当液位低于设定值时自动启动补水，并设置低液位报警。</sysml:Text>
      <sysml:VerifiedBy method="commissioning_check" />
      <sysml:DerivedFrom refId="ER-P042" />
      <sysml:Traceability>
        <Evidence id="E-EXP-CAP-001" supportStatus="verified_by_direct_evidence" />
        <Evidence id="E-CTRL-COOL-002" supportStatus="verified_by_direct_evidence" />
        <Evidence id="E-SUPP-COMM-001" supportStatus="verified_by_direct_evidence" />
      </sysml:Traceability>
      <sysml:QualityStatus>
        <SupportStatus>verified_by_direct_evidence</SupportStatus>
        <RiskIfUnmet>无法自动补水将导致系统失水、压力下降，影响主机冷却安全。</RiskIfUnmet>
      </sysml:QualityStatus>
      <sysml:AcceptanceCriteria>
        <Criterion>检查图纸确认自动补水回路及低液位报警设置符合DNV规则要求。</Criterion>
        <Criterion>调试期间模拟低液位，确认自动补水启动，低液位报警正确触发。</Criterion>
      </sysml:AcceptanceCriteria>
      <sysml:EngineeringRationale>本条覆盖方面【膨胀水箱自动补水功能】，来自原始需求「自动补水功能」。E-EXP-CAP-001（DNV规则）支撑了低液位报警和填充连接要求；E-CTRL-COOL-002（IACS UR E10）支撑了液位监测和报警；E-SUPP-COMM-001（调试清单）支撑了液位范围及报警测试。</sysml:EngineeringRationale>
      <sysml:QualityGateReport passed="true" score="1.0">
